    <panel_attributes>CoopPilot — Stage 2 class diagram 3/3: facade, web GUI (Spring MVC + SSE), CLI (picocli) and application tracking (as implemented).
Patterns: Facade (CoopPilotFacade, used by every controller and the CLI), State (Application/ApplicationState),
Observer (ApplicationTracker -&gt; DashboardService; AgentSession -&gt; SseProgressPublisher). AgentSessionManager runs agents in the background.
fontsize=11
bg=yellow</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
